WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.343
Your Inbox holds the questions agents are waiting on you to answer.

00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:06.381
This one is the Planner's.

00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:10.711
Pick an option, and give your reason in a note.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.982
Unclear?

00:00:13.982 --> 00:00:16.239
Ask back instead.

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:19.306
Answered, it leaves your Inbox.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.890
The Planner's next question is on the same spec.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:24.872
Open it there.

00:00:27.076 --> 00:00:30.011
The decision block keeps the option you picked,

00:00:31.044 --> 00:00:31.779
your reason,

00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:34.297
and who answered.
